OL,3,ABurnham holds cabinet meeting ahead of
OL,4,Afirst address to Commons as PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, he said people convicted of
OL,7,Funlawful killing - including
OL,8,Fmanslaughter - would not be eligible
OL,9,Ffor earlier release in England and
OL,10,FWales
OL,12,FThe plans for more spaces include
OL,13,Fconverting "unused office space,
OL,14,Flaundry rooms and storage areas" into
OL,15,Fcells
